[BriefingSubmissions.ATTACK.attack_usa.defend_prk.Mission.Objectives]
Capture the inhabited locality marked on the map.

[BriefingSubmissions.ATTACK.attack_usa.defend_prk.Mission.Description]
US forces have fortified an inhabited locality in the mountain valley, and concentrated their forces there. This location is the sole transport corridor connecting the southern and northern parts of the ridge. You must destroy the enemy's defenses with a concentrated attack, and capture the locality.

[BriefingSubmissions.DEFEND.defend_usa.attack_prk.Mission.Objectives]
Repel all enemy attacks and deliver a counterattack, if possible. Do not let the enemy capture the inhabited locality.

[BriefingSubmissions.DEFEND.defend_usa.attack_prk.Mission.Description]
According to reconnaissance, the enemy is concentrating its forces for an attack. They will most likely attempt to break through the positions defended by your combat team. You must not let that happen.

[BriefingSubmissions.SIEGE.defend_usa.attack_prk.Mission.Description]
According to reconnaissance, the enemy is concentrating its forces for an attack. They will most likely attempt to break through the positions defended by your combat team. You must not let that happen.

[BriefingSubmissions.SIEGE.defend_usa.attack_prk.Mission.Objectives]
Repel all enemy attacks and deliver a counterattack, if possible. Do not let the enemy capture the inhabited locality.

[BriefingSubmissions.STORM.attack_usa.assault_prk.Mission.Objectives]
Capture the inhabited locality.

[BriefingSubmissions.STORM.attack_usa.assault_prk.Mission.Description]
According to air reconnaissance, an enemy force is moving towards the inhabited locality marked on the map. This location stands on a strategic road junction, and is critical for our offensive. Do not allow the enemy to capture the locality. Attack and, if possible, eliminate hostiles on the march. If the enemy beats you to the location, begin your assault immediately, before they have a chance to establish their defenses.

[BriefingSubmissions.AI_STORM.assault_usa.attack_prk.Mission.Objectives]
Capture the high point marked on the map.

[BriefingSubmissions.AI_STORM.assault_usa.attack_prk.Mission.Description]
The high point marked on the map is the strategic key to controlling two road junctions, so capturing it in time is critical. Capture the high point and hold it for the specified time, until our main forces arrive. Be ready to repel any enemy counterattacks.

